BRepCheck: the 2d closure check of a wire (BRepCheck_Wire::Closed2d,
IsClosed2dForPeriodicFace) went through all edges of the face for each of
its wires to find its seam edges, and BRepCheck_Wire::InContext searched the
face for the wire: quadratic in the wires of a face (a face with thousands
of holes). BRepCheck_Analyzer finds the seam edges once per face
(BRepCheck_Wire::SeamEdges) and checks each wire of the face with
BRepCheck_Wire::InContextOfFace, which uses them and skips the search; other
callers keep InContext and Closed2d. The seam edges, the checks and their
statuses are unchanged.
